# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This repository is the BRAND repository, not an open-source project. It is
# public only because three public READMEs load their brand header from
# raw.githubusercontent.com/ribaudequin/ribaudequin/main/assets/ :
#
#   epub-library-manager, clavis, ValidadorPT
#
# So the public tree carries exactly four things: README.md, LICENSE, and those
# two SVGs in assets/. Everything else is working material and stays local.
#
# Do not add the directories below back. `git add -A` would otherwise republish
# them, which is exactly how the raw captures got out the first time.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# The whole working tree, kept out of the public repository.
brand/
posts/
profiles/
mockups/
scripts/

